    //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    // Daylight Saving Time (Table 6-65) and Time-of-Use season/
    // schedule/holiday configuration (Table 6-66). Each season/
    // schedule-segment/holiday entry is 3 registers the manual
    // describes only as one opaque block (e.g. "data and Season
    // table of the 1st Season"), with no documented internal byte
    // layout, so each register is modeled individually with a
    // descriptive suffix (e.g. "(Month)", "(Day)", "(Schedule ID)")
